# Build context is the repo root (the workspaces need each other), so this
# excludes from there.
#
# The name matters: BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` for a `-f` build
# and only falls back to `<context>/.dockerignore`. A file called
# `web/.dockerignore` would be read for neither and silently ignored.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/cdk.out
.git
.github
api
db
scripts
mobile
infra
docs
**/*.test.ts
**/test
.env
.env.*
**/.expo
**/.DS_Store
